OL,3,GNEWSAStaff slept while patient killed
OL,4,Aat NHS mental health unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff falsified records, slept and were
OL,7,Fon their phones on the night one
OL,8,Fpatient was killed by another on an NHS
OL,9,Fmental health unit in east London, an
OL,10,Finquest has heard.
OL,12,FHugo Flint-Cahan, 34, was being treated
OL,13,Fat Newham Mental Health Centre (NMHC),
OL,14,Frun by the East London NHS Trust
OL,15,F(ELFT), when he was fatally attacked by
OL,16,F22-year-old Rolando Torres-Pena.
OL,18,FHugo's family say they have been
OL,19,Fshocked by the "dangerous" failures in
OL,20,Fhis care.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
