OL,3,GNEWSAStaff slept while patient killed
OL,4,Aat NHS mental health unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Trust told the coroner they had
OL,7,Faddressed some of the issues raised in
OL,8,Fthe inquest, and are launching an
OL,9,Finvestigation into the staff whose
OL,10,Ffailings have been identified.
